        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, asphalt shingle roofs typically cost between $8,500 and $18,000 installed for a standard home, while metal roofs range from $20,000 to $40,000 or more\n\n. Per square foot, asphalt runs about $4.50 to $7.50, whereas metal ranges from $7.00 to $14.00+ depending on whether you choose exposed fastener panels or standing seam.",
